GET http://localhost:3005  HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
### Get all items
GET http://localhost:3005/api/items HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create new item
POST http://localhost:3005/api/items HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Example",
    "value": 123
}

### Get item by ID
GET http://localhost:3005/dashboard/devices/1?username=admin&password=admin123 HTTP/1.1

Content-Type: application/json


### Update item
PUT http://localhost:3005/dashboard/devices/1?username=user&password=pass HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Updated"
}

### Delete item
DELETE http://localhost:3005/dashboard/devices/1?username=user&password=pass HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
